#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_product_pricelist__wubook_flatten_to_daily
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_product_pricelist__wubook_flatten_to_daily
msgid ""
"If set, this pricelist will be exported to Wubook as an independent daily "
"plan, computing the final price for each room type and date on the fly by "
"walking the full chain of parent pricelists. Use this when you need more "
"than one level of derived pricelists (e.g. A -> B +15% -> C +breakfast), "
"which Wubook does not support natively."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, esta tarifa se exporta a Wubook como un plan diario "
"independiente, calculando al vuelo el precio final de cada tipo de "
"habitación y fecha recorriendo toda la cadena de tarifas padre. Úsalo cuando"
" necesites más de un nivel de tarifas derivadas (p. ej. A -> B +15% -> C "
"+desayuno), que Wubook no admite de forma nativa."

